11	
12	/**
13	 * A file manager, rather than a directory listing.
14	 *
15	 * What this replaces showed one flat list of the current directory with a
16	 * Rename and a Delete per row: no folder tree, no search, no multi-select, no
17	 * sorting, and an editor that opened as a modal over the top of everything.
18	 * The concept's Files screen is a three-pane browser, and every piece of it is
19	 * backed by an action that already existed.
20	 *
21	 * DELIBERATELY ABSENT: move and copy. `renameEntry` renames within the SAME
22	 * parent by design, and there is no action that relocates a path — so a Move
23	 * button would be a button that cannot work. Bulk delete is real (it is N
24	 * deletes) and is offered; bulk move is not.
25	 */
